# Line endings (2026-10-16): every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every machine - the repository
# has always held LF, and a Windows checkout converting to CRLF made every edit warn "LF will be replaced by CRLF".
# Binaries are never converted. Hashes over file bytes (warden/docs/safety-pins.sha256) depend on this staying LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary
*.pem binary
